-- ============================================================================
-- GIC APPRENTICE LMS — MODULE 3 CONTENT
-- Credit, Debt, and Lending
-- ============================================================================
-- Updates module 3 metadata + content. Status remains 'draft' until Cathy
-- Jackson-Gent approves via the admin UI. Safe to re-run; uses UPDATE.
